YieldcoinShare_setCCIPAdmin
  ├── when the caller does not have CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
  ├── when the new admin is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with YieldcoinShare__NoZeroAddress
  └── when the call is valid
      ├── it should update the CCIP admin
      └── it should emit a CCIPAdminTransferred event
